{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1522071-the-cosmic-wheel-sisterhood-a-game-for-mage-fans","id":1522071,"title":"The Cosmic Wheel Sisterhood, a game for mage fans","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-09-04T14:05:27-07:00","id":1522071,"title":"The Cosmic Wheel Sisterhood, a game for mage fans","content":"Greetings fellow mages, I come to you to talk about a game that I honestly believe is perfect for every mage fan, or just a good game in general if you like the genre: The Cosmic Wheel Sisterhood, available on steam. It's a narrative-based game where you play as a witch who has been exiled to an asteroid for a thousand years. On the brink of desperation, she summons a forbidden entity and makes a pact with it to help her escape. In the process, she has to build a tarot from scratch that helps you influence the game. It has everything I love: Quircky Witches, spiritual entities, political intrigue between cabals, Cosmic mysteries, metaphysical symbolism, etc... As I played, I could easily picture her as a marauder kicked out from reality, a mage trapped in a paradox realm, or just a regular mage punished unjustly by the council of traditions. I highly recommend it if you want to show someone a taste of what mage the ascension can be or if you just want to enjoy a game that will rekindle your passion for magic, the arcane, and the esoteric.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thanked